If you get aggravate monsters just remember where the
good closets are with the closeable doors on them and
when your hit points go a bit low go into a closet
close the door and rest and get the hit points back.
The only monsters that will be able to hassle you in there
are the ones with hands and they're worth killing in any event.
If you have a wand of digging on you you might want to dig some
pits outside the closet but leave the position adjacent to the
door unpitted.  This way, you can rest up and get all your
hit points back come out and kill everything in the pits,
go back in and recover, come out and repeat the
process.  You should have jumping boots on since if
you make a complete perimeter around that position with five
pits you'll need to jump over to make your escape unless you have a
scroll of teleport and ring of teleport control.

